{2}{3}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse point-slope form through $(1,-5)$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ny-(-5)&=\\frac{2}{3}(x-(1)), \\\\y&=\\frac{2 x}{3} - \\frac{17}{3}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAt the $y$-axis, $x=0$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ny&=\\frac{2}{3}\\cdot 0+\\left(- \\frac{17}{3}\\right), \\\\y&=- \\frac{17}{3}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe intersection is $\\left(0,- \\frac{17}{3}\\right)$." 13194139547578 17592186576411 true]] :edb/tempids {"00e8d86d-1129-5622-a67f-6cdd2601671e" 17592186761055 "0528d2f1-a7ca-57e0-815f-c74f80d05fe5" 17592186761056 "105f3b7c-32d3-5721-896a-80a7e4481dd8" 17592186761057 "1bc39092-d8e9-5453-8c18-574cb938a383" 17592186761058 "29406d9f-bf1b-52ad-b004-ccc298593364" 17592186761059 "2ed6c176-c8ce-5e49-a7ef-0346fa82cc02" 17592186761060 "3d28ea72-04ae-5db8-b62d-9aec5492882b" 17592186761061 "4d6ce5d3-903a-5e82-90e6-9d71c4be85f4" 17592186761062 "568999d4-4889-5a98-bcd1-0e4e8ca80b91" 17592186761063 "6793f98f-38e5-5e4e-87b0-0c228eeb1231" 17592186761064 "71568e09-28aa-59ac-8ca3-5dbb95764716" 17592186761065 "7a507089-6cf8-5df8-b8df-3ac97398dd75" 17592186761066 "963d8c9b-cc10-5c12-8b87-028a86b2e2b6" 17592186761067 "987575de-1233-554d-bad4-462cace7ab49" 17592186761068 "9b36f04f-29a4-57f4-b792-3d8cddf7dbb7" 17592186761069 "9e991031-582e-5686-a53b-62bf31e1399b" 17592186761070 "9f59a7a4-1543-5be4-a86a-343a53b151e1" 17592186761071 "9fffbf35-c438-5860-919c-71e3071c2bff" 17592186761072 "b29dd078-2ebc-5d53-826e-4eebe7992cae" 17592186761073 "c0b9097b-e0d1-5242-9d99-bd382092dbc9" 17592186761074 "d88521b3-53b8-5a17-a4c2-f70e3754ec37" 17592186761075 "e756993e-1199-53fc-a2ee-d01738092d6f" 17592186761076 "edf92b3a-5431-50ab-beed-623ef07b5994" 17592186761077 "f5e6aff2-b373-5430-b1d1-8590f82466c7" 17592186761078 "faa54547-2c59-5b03-b679-878d5c36016f" 17592186761079}}
